{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Monodex",
    "description": "Collection da API Monodex (gym-ctrl admin + notifly).\n\n## Como usar\n1. Importe este arquivo no Postman.\n2. Ajuste as variáveis da collection: `gymBaseUrl`, `notiflyBaseUrl`, `adminEmail`, `adminPassword`.\n3. Rode **Auth → Login** — o script salva `token` automaticamente.\n4. Rotas `/admin/*` usam Bearer Token (`{{token}}`) e exigem role `SUPER_ADMIN`.\n\n## Seed local\n```bash\nNODE_ENV=development npx ts-node prisma/seed-platform-admin.ts\n```\nDefaults: `platform-admin@local.dev` / `platform-admin-dev`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gymBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
    {
      "key": "notiflyBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "platform-admin@local.dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "platform-admin-dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "whatsappAccountId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "wabaId",
      "value": "SET_WABA_ID"
    },
    {
      "key": "templateId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "scrapeTargetId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantUuid",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
    },
    {
      "key": "listId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "leadId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "campaignId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token salvo na collection', () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gymBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Retorna `{ token }`. O test script grava em `{{token}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check (gym)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gymBaseUrl}}/health-check"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
